Subject: [PATCH v5 05/12] arm64/mm: Add FEAT_LPA2 specific ID_AA64MMFR0.TGRAN[2]
Date: Thu, 16 Nov 2023 14:29:24 +0000
Message-Id: <20231116142931.1675485-6-ryan.roberts@arm.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.25.1
In-Reply-To: <20231116142931.1675485-1-ryan.roberts@arm.com>
